{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8ebf75edca6cb7e0a917f7ade6529e8dbddc04e664d9364e4e860c577b72383e", "ja": "（映画『完全犯罪のお時間です♪』の準備は順調だ。\n何もなければ、あとはクランクアップを待つだけ……）", "zh": "（电影《完美犯罪的时间♪》准备得很顺利。如果不出什么意外，接下来只要等杀青了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "b6a418a9e48cb3e9a8f7ed13fd354a80d74a1caa33ea3b4c4c019e6f920370b1", "ja": "し、失礼します！\n助けてください、{$P$}！", "zh": "失、失礼了！\n请帮帮我，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1002_p", "source_sha256": "20159d30a96b765b85ced635f588510ee891966f3a7a62494d266b3314407565", "ja": "お疲れさま、琴葉。\nあれ、衣装の試着中か？　似合ってるな！", "zh": "辛苦了，琴叶。\n咦，你正在试穿演出服吗？很适合你啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "3962a35aae33e7d36e6fbdb33363955484bdf21c385b5b879e891fbc45b2d8ec", "ja": "あっ、ありがとうございます……じゃなくて！\nすみません、すこしの間、腕を貸してもらえませんか？", "zh": "啊，谢谢您……不对，不是这个！\n不好意思，可以借我一会儿您的手臂吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b9cea66c9458ae49a0c11a777712c2662878d79efcb5fc5a9efbafafbaa80771", "ja": "力じゃなくて、腕なのか？\n貸すのは構わないけど、何かあったのか？", "zh": "不是要借力气，而是借胳膊吗？\n借给你倒是没问题，不过发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "e5f2f056708981e5e51c3eadacd43b1a0f1a61a0d3849e3f9df8fcceca5470c5", "ja": "そ、そうですよね、すみません。\nえっと、どこから話せばいいんだろう……。", "zh": "对、对啊，确实是这样，抱歉。\n那个……该从哪里说起好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5188b0115e2f852926ca0aa7734a267139894cd05f908f09f2f62c35d0e511bb", "ja": "今の時間は……出演者のみんなと、本読みか。", "zh": "现在这个时间……是要和出演人员一起读剧本吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "d224275824d3f17389a66041f01128e5aa20c1489f5b3f937095eb1f28c71411", "ja": "はい。劇中に、採血のシーンがあったので……\n本物らしく見えるよう、練習しようって話になって。", "zh": "是的。因为剧中有抽血的场景……\n所以大家商量着要练习一下，让它看起来更真实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "77c5b86d74a443cd18ff5c904b5a4ee69ebd9c68ac028afa3d737fd4a974d7f9", "ja": "もちろん、本当にやるわけじゃありませんけど。\nでも、看護師としてのリアリティは求められますから。", "zh": "当然不是真的要做。不过，作为护士，还是需要有真实感才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1009_p", "source_sha256": "083658f994a87ebc58723eedaec2779cda7cd7c96301e4339148c380f43d2d03", "ja": "もちろん。一応職業ものだし、そういったシーンに\n違和感があると、肝心の事件に集中できないもんな。", "zh": "当然。毕竟是职业题材，要是在那种场景里感到违和，就没法集中精力处理关键案件了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "0dc004c6b2433bf479b9b288db8cf07f6765804739624a8a847abb6b5f17fe52", "ja": "はい。なので全員衣装に着替えて、経験者の風花さんに\nレクチャーしてもらっていたんです。でも……。", "zh": "是的。所以大家都换上了服装，请有经验的风花姐给我们讲解。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a4257553f062570d144a4df244308bd007b433f9850b9d4e3925f8dd572b48a0", "ja": "でも？", "zh": "但是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "e4d084f4ece096754c6d0cb17fd159bdad2bee57bc182c7fb362681a257251f7", "ja": "患者さん役が、百合子ちゃんしかいなくて……。\n私たち全員、看護師とお医者さんなので。", "zh": "因为找不到病人角色，只有百合子……。\n我们所有人演的都是护士和医生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "78be6c6edce39d27ff47fcb36481b83447773cfdb2f5350c56151ea9ab20f087", "ja": "そうしたら未来が、「患者さんを探してくる！」って\nいきなり飛び出して行ってしまって……。", "zh": "然后未来突然说了句“我去找患者！”就跑出去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6807f7366cf18ee8ee4aa0019eab33a1a2c1bd174ae6463c1cb86cebf36f3f95", "ja": "想像がつくな……。", "zh": "我能想象得到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "7433e4f994afca4dc6a2585d6ce0eb301b22ee9b719f2490c6096f7607e0d32d", "ja": "はい……。未来は、風花さんが追いかけてくれたので。\n私は、患者さん役ができる人を探しに来たんですけど。", "zh": "嗯……未来是风花小姐追过来的。所以我来找能演病人的人，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1016_p", "source_sha256": "43d69515b3d74ea4f5f234f02add95322c9e42e8ebb94588278d8523aa451b3e", "ja": "よし、患者さん役なら任せろ！　……でもその前に、\n風花を手伝った方がいいかもしれないな。", "zh": "好，扮演患者的话就包在我身上！……不过在那之前，\n可能还是先去帮风花比较好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0423_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "2472cab265315a5c09bb65b44183dc65bbc0398ae6aca5054f82513bcfa9c5a1", "ja": "そ、そうですよね！　私ったら、慌ててて……。\nお願いします、{$P$}！", "zh": "对、对啊！我真是的，慌慌张张的……\n拜托您了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
